<details class="trip-receipt"<%~ it.clientGameStateEconomyReceiptOpen %>><summary>Recent trip · <%~ it.economyReceipt2Net %><%~ it.credits2 %> <span class="dim small">goods and refining only</span></summary><div class="small"><%~ it.label %></div><div class="kv"><span>Sold goods</span><span><%~ it.credits22 %></span></div><div class="kv"><span>Bought goods</span><span>−<%~ it.credits23 %></span></div><div class="kv"><span>Refining costs</span><span>−<%~ it.credits24 %></span></div><%~ it.economyReceipt2Refunds %><p class="dim small">Supplies bought before departure and sales at your latest stop. New purchases belong to your next trip. This is not your full profit: other rewards, fuel, repairs and ship costs are not included.</p></details>